  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "a.m.0:38 天候/砂嵐\n龍門市街 広場 屋外パーティー会場"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "指示の通り来ましたけど、なんで……屋外パーティー？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "あのロウソク見える！？　でっかーい！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "エクシア、もう少し静かに。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "空気に甘ったるい匂いが充満しているな、少し気分が悪い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#3",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "うーん……もしここに店でも出しよったら、大儲けできるかもしれへんなぁ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ソラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "テキサスさん、ボスから連絡は？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "今のところはない。どこかで酔いつぶれてるのかもしれないな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "……エクシア、私の頭に乗ってるこれを取ってくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "えっー、なんでよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "私なんか、こんなノッポなパーティーハットは全然かぶれないんだからね、この頭の蛍光灯モドキのせいで。本当はめちゃくちゃ羨ましいんだよ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ソラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "じゃあもし、無理矢理にでもかぶってたらどうなるの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "んー、二日酔の状態でテキサスの運転する車の助手席に座って突っ走る……みたいな感じかな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "……そら、想像するだけでもエラいことやな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ソラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "本当に試したことあるんだ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "そんで、ボスはどこにいるのーっ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "それにしても、ここは人が多すぎますよ。もし敵がここまで追ってきたら、一般人を巻き込むことになりますよ——。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェイ",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "あっ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "……あなた方は、ペンギン急便の。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "確かキミは……あの探偵事務所のアルバイトの子……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "隣の方は噂の親分さん？　包丁一本で港の辺りを張ってるっていう……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェイ",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "違いやす。てか、そこまで大げさな噂があるんすか……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェイ",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "俺ぁただのしがない商人ですよ。あっ、今夜は鱗獣団子屋もやってやすが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "あなたがテキサスさんですね？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "今夜に起こったこと、知らないなんて言わせませんよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェイ",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "ワイフー、そんなに突っかかるこたぁねぇよ。皆さんもただ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "わかってます。ですがこの手の事件が起こった回数はもはや可笑しくなるくらいですよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "もし他の人を巻き込んでいなかったら、まだ目をつぶってあげられますけど。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "無実の市民を巻き込み、公共の財産に損失を負わせるなんて、あなたたちには龍門の一市民としての自覚がないんですか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（完全に返す言葉もないって感じだ！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "……だからなんだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "だから、あなたたちの腐った根性を叩き直す必要があります。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ソラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "こ、拳で殴り合う喧嘩は止めよ？　あたしたちも今夜はたくさん迷惑かけちゃったってわかってるから、まずは話し合おうよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "——わかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ソラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "テキサスさん！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "言っておくが、今夜のことは私自身も意味がわからないんだ。それに正直疲れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "だから今の機嫌はあまり良くない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "わかるか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "一対一で私が勝ったら、あなたたちには今後法規をしっかりと守っていただきます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "……最低でも一ヶ月は。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（一ヶ月だけでいいんだ！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "私が勝ったら、キミのところの、いつも本業を放ったらかして余計なことに首を突っ込む奴らに、大人しくしてもらおう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "うっ、それはもっともな話……、しかし容赦はしませんよ！　準備は良いですか！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェイ",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "はぁ、どうしてこうなっちまったんすかね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "待ってください！　皆さんちょっと落ち着きましょうよ！　いくらなんでも街のど真ん中で殴り合いの喧嘩だなんて——。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "カンフーか、良い腕してらぁ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "狼の姉ちゃんも負けるな！　行け！　後ろに気をつけろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "こんなに綺麗な炎国カンフーは久しぶりに見たぞ！　もっと技を見せてくれ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "これは見世物じゃないですよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ソラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "テキサスさん！　頑張ってください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "足元に気をつけて！　そこフェイントだよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "皆さんも一緒になって煽らないでください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェイ",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "ソーダでももらってきやしょうか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#2",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "お！　兄ちゃん、おおきに。アンタはあの喧嘩、止めるつもりなさそうやね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェイ",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "止めらんねえでしょうね、あの様子見てりゃ分かりやす。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "……ぼくたちこうして見てるだけ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェイ",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "何なら応援でもしてやりゃあいいのでは？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "放送",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*ノイズ*――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "……何だろう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "放送",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "オーイ！　安魂夜のパーティーにお越しの善良な市民たちー！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "なんだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何事だ、アイツ何なんだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "放送",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聞こえてるか～い？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "おい、うるせえぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "放送",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "いいねいいね、聞こえてるみたいだな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "放送",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ではこっからは静かにしてくれ！　静かに！　どうも！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "放送",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "さぁ、耳の穴かっぽじって俺にひれ伏しな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "な、何なんだアイツは！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "待て！　あれはエンペラーだ！　おい、MSRのラップの神だぞ！　早く来いよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "アイツはクルビアにいたはずじゃ！？　どうして龍門に？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "……エンペラーさん、何してるんです？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "ボスはいつもミュージシャン気取りだからさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ソラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "実際ミュージシャンだけどね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "ウチらの資金源は、運送業務だけやないっちゅーこった。ボスの資金ルートは、ホンマ複雑なんや。それに——。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "それに？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#4",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "いや、止めとこか。話し過ぎるんはヤバイ気がするんや。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "どうしました、動きが鈍くなってますよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "……人の流れの動きが整いすぎている。この状況はおかしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "言い訳は結構です！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "エンペラー！　エンペラー！　エンペラー！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "エンペラー！　エンペラー！　エンペラー！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "——。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……やかましいのう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今日は安魂祭。エンペラーさんや、お主の騒音は死人さえも煩くて目を覚ましてしまうぞ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "なっ——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "お前、いつの間に……俺の背後に……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "さてお主はもう眠る時間じゃな。良い安魂祭を。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "……このクソネズミが、おぼえ……とけよ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ちょっと、どうしたんだ？　何かの演出か——。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "エンペラー？　エンペラーが刺された？　死んだのか！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "はっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ワイフー",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "ふんっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うぐぁ——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェイ",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "おい？　ワイフー、相手を間違えて——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "いや。彼女は何も間違えてない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "囲まれてるんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "イベント参加者？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "げぇ……。まさか、スラムからずっとここまで追って来たの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "ここいらに、ぎょうさんいる人ら、みんなアイツらの仲間っちゅーことなん？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ソラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "ウソでしょ、この人数……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "周りはほぼ敵ですよ！　これは罠です。エンペラーさんは——。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "――っ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "このマイクはどうやって使うのじゃ……。あー、あー、ゴホン。龍門市民の諸君、こんばんは。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "慌てないでくだされ。いま死んだのは取るに足らないペンギン一羽のみ、安魂夜の式典は継続されよう。もちろん、目障りの死体は専門の業者に処理させる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "諸君をいきなり驚かせてすまない。そして今宵のイベントに臨時の演目を一つ追加しておいた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "シラクーザからの友人が、ワシらのために特別なプレゼントを持ってきてくれたのじゃ。今はこのパーティー会場のどこかに隠してある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "残り時間は多くはないぞ、諸君。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（ぼくを見てる？　いや、待って、あのご老人は——。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "もし誰もこのプレゼントを見つけられぬ時は、残念ながら――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "お主らの人生で最後のサプライズになるのじゃ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
